Of course, duh!

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.690
I was just taking out just enough to eat!

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:23.490
Alright, here we go.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.060
Get in there, get in there! Yeah!

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.950
Don't be afraid of the
mess, that's the key.

