00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:43.120
- You sweetie.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.050
Look at those teeth!

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.220
- Right?
- [Jack] Damn!

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.503
- My dad's a dentist, so...

00:00:46.503 --> 00:00:47.510
- You know what?

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.770
I was winning for a while, but then

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.600
