00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.940
What, this one is ridiculous!

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.343
I'm sorry!

00:01:14.343 --> 00:01:15.870
- Damn, this is hard.

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:16.960
How much time do we have left?

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:18.940
What is this web?
- What are you talking about?

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:20.210
How did they get to the web?

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.932
- I think they skipped a paragraph.

00:01:21.932 --> 00:01:23.790
- Okay, I'm just gonna
make a web outta this.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:25.473
- Okay, I'm just gonna start taping.

00:01:25.473 --> 00:01:27.430
And I'm the person, if
a kid comes to my door,

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:30.640
I'll give them just peppermints
and not actual candies.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:32.010
- Peppermints are candy.

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:33.352
