00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.390
You give a kid peppermints at Halloween.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.810
What? No!

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.150
Use black sharpie to sketch out some..

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:42.330
(Jack groans)

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.940
There's my spiderweb.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:46.740
I'm gonna give it to Quinta.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.660
- Yes! Thanks, Jack!

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:50.853
I really admire what you did do with that.

00:01:50.853 --> 00:01:51.830
- I did my best.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.320
- You made something out of nothing, and..

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.790
- I did my best.
- [Quinta] that was good.

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:58.443
