- [Jack] No, that's good.

00:02:05.393 --> 00:02:08.343
- Stuff the inside with a
tablespoon of sunflower butter.

00:02:08.343 --> 00:02:09.843
- That can't be good.

00:02:09.843 --> 00:02:11.053
Amazingly delicious.

00:02:11.053 --> 00:02:13.093
- Yeah, you realize that the dynamics

00:02:13.093 --> 00:02:14.353
of a sunflower seed, that there's

00:02:14.353 --> 00:02:16.393
