00:02:20.183 --> 00:02:22.683
Right to the jugular.

00:02:22.683 --> 00:02:24.773
- Oh, my God. Are you okay?

00:02:24.773 --> 00:02:26.613
- Yeah

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:29.173
Let's do this. You know you want it!

00:02:29.173 --> 00:02:31.363
- Oh, okay!

00:02:31.363 --> 00:02:32.743
It does make a good snack!

00:02:32.743 --> 00:02:34.413
- What does that remind you of?

00:02:34.413 --> 00:02:36.693
- How 'bout that one?

00:02:36.693 --> 00:02:38.323
