00:02:56.513 --> 00:02:58.713
I wanna be on the Kanye ticket in 2020.

00:02:58.713 --> 00:03:00.853
- Black Kanye? Kanye Black?

00:03:00.853 --> 00:03:02.103
- [Jack] It's Kanye Black.
- Yeah

00:03:02.103 --> 00:03:03.483
- Let's not get crazy.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:07.073
